      "readme": "This dataset contains multi-echo fMRI data from an odor and visual similarity experiment.\n\nEach participant underwent anatomical T1-weighted imaging and three functional runs:\n1. odor run 1\n2. visual run 1\n3. odor run 2\n\nFunctional images were acquired as multi-echo BOLD scans with four echoes per run. Therefore, each complete subject has 12 BOLD files: 3 runs × 4 echoes.\n\nValidator note:\nThe BIDS validator reports an INCONSISTENT_PARAMETERS warning because the functional data were acquired using a multi-echo BOLD sequence. Each functional run contains four echoes, represented with the echo-1, echo-2, echo-3, and echo-4 entities in the filenames. The expected EchoTime values differ across echoes, while RepetitionTime and task structure are consistent across runs.\n",
